BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:solmates-season-opener-ft-fahlberg-orsay-more@shotgun.live
DTSTAMP:20260921T191357Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T191357Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART:20261010T020000Z
DTEND:20261010T070000Z
SUMMARY:Solmates Season Opener Ft. Fahlberg\, Orsay & More
LOCATION:ZeyZey Miami\, 353 Northeast 61st Street\, Miami\, FL 33137\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Solmates brings together two European producers whose work meet
 s at the intersection of melody\, groove\, and late-night dance music. Bui
 lt around a shared appreciation for emotional\, forward-thinking electroni
 c music\, Solmates creates a space where established sounds and new perspe
 ctives can meet on the dancefloor. Stockholm-born Fahlberg has built his s
 ound around deep basslines\, hypnotic textures\, and what he describes as 
 “Nordic Melodic” — a Scandinavian sense of atmosphere shaped through
  contemporary house and techno. His releases have appeared on labels inclu
 ding Diynamic\, Watergate\, Siamese\, MoBlack\, and When Stars Align\, wit
 h support from Solomun\, Keinemusik\, Black Coffee\, and Pete Tong. Tracks
  such as “Somebody” and “Chaka” have reached major Beatport chart 
 positions\, while recent work includes collaborations with Layer J\, Argø
 des\, and Jeremy Olander\, alongside an official remix for RÜFÜS DU SOL.
  Joining him is Paris- and London-based Orsay\, a producer whose melodic h
 ouse sound is informed by an early classical background. Having studied pi
 ano from the age of six and trained at a music conservatory\, Orsay brings
  that foundation into productions built around rhythm\, emotion\, and melo
 dy. His music has been released through Ninja Tune\, Siamese\, Universal M
 usic\, and Kitsuné\, with tracks including “Mind Off\,” “Amado\,”
  and “Magik” receiving support from Adriatique\, Solomun\, WhoMadeWho
 \, Carlita\, and RÜFÜS DU SOL. In 2025\, he took his sets across Europe
 \, the UAE\, and South America. Together\, Fahlberg and Orsay represent th
 e sound and spirit behind Solmates: a meeting point for artists and audien
 ces drawn to melodic\, groove-led electronic music\, with a focus on conne
 ction\, discovery\, and the energy of the night. Rooted in Europe but look
 ing outward\, Solmates brings together different musical backgrounds and p
 erspectives under one shared atmosphere — where melody meets movement an
 d the right records create lasting moments. 21+ event\nLineup: Fahlberg\, 
 Orsay\nTags: house\, afro house\, melodic house & techno\nPresented by: So
 lmates Miami\nTickets: VIP (1st Release) $50\, Entry before 11 PM $10\, En
 try Anytime (1st Release) $25\nhttps://shotgun.live/en/events/solmates-sea
 son-opener-ft-fahlberg-orsay-more\nhttps://edmtrain.com/miami-fl/solmates-
 fahlberg-534168
URL:https://shotgun.live/en/events/solmates-season-opener-ft-fahlberg-orsay
 -more
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:house,afro house,melodic house & techno
GEO:25.8327584;-80.1890685
END:VEVENT
