SUMMARY:Paloma Morphy
LOCATION:ZeyZey Miami\, 353 Northeast 61st Street\, Miami\, FL 33137\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Rescheduled Date / Refund Requests: Due to unforeseen circumsta
 nces\, unfortunately Paloma Morphy has had to postpone her upcoming tour a
 nd the originally-scheduled September 30\, 2026 tour date @ ZeyZey has bee
 n rescheduled to May 12\, 2027 @ ZeyZey. If you are unable to attend the r
 escheduled date\, current ticket holders have 7 days to request a refund v
 ia the form linked below. The refund request period closes Tues\, Sept 22
 \, 11:59pm. If you'd like to request a refund\, please fill out the below 
 form in full and refunds will be processed as they are received. Please al
 low a few business days for the refund to hit your account. https://forms.
 gle/nrUYem5EqBQ5QJeWA ---- Paloma Morphy With special guest(s) to be annou
 nced soon. Where: ZeyZey Miami 353 NE 61 Street Miami\, Florida\, 33137 Wh
 en: May 12\, 2027 <-- rescheduled date! Doors: 7:00 PM Age: 18+ An Escala 
 Sonora Event Powered by: Mishu --- Miami is set for a captivating night as
  Paloma Morphy\, the rising singer-songwriter from Monterrey\, Mexico\, br
 ings her emotionally raw and genre-bending sound to ZeyZey on September 30
 . Fresh off a breakout year that saw her win the 2025 Latin GRAMMY for Bes
 t New Artist and earn recognition from Rolling Stone\, Apple Music\, Spoti
 fy\, and Billboard as one of the most exciting emerging voices in Latin mu
 sic\, Paloma is redefining modern pop through vulnerability\, minimalist p
 roduction\, and striking storytelling. With over 50 million streams on her
  debut album 'Au' and sold-out shows across Mexico\, her live performances
  feel intimate\, honest\, and deeply immersive. Don’t miss the chance to
  experience one of Latin pop’s fastest-rising artists in Miami this fall
 \nLineup: Paloma Morphy\nTags: latin\, indie pop\, pop\nPresented by: Mish
 u\nTickets: GA - Tier 1 $20\nhttps://shotgun.live/en/events/paloma-morphy-
 miami
URL:https://shotgun.live/en/events/paloma-morphy-miami
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:latin,indie pop,pop
GEO:25.8327584;-80.1890685
END:VEVENT
